{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405070/extras/4ff56390fc41ea54d93f4e8b8bcafb8b.poster.avif?t=1768427011\" width=610 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405070/extras/4ff56390fc41ea54d93f4e8b8bcafb8b.webm?t=1768427011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Trick or Beat?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">There are <strong>two</strong> ways of winning in this game:<br><u>Trick:</u> You manage to fill up your trick-pile</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u>Beat:</u> You defeat all creatures of your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405070/extras/d3e6bf4717c6597c0e50af7016f63c0a.poster.avif?t=1768427011\" width=610 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405070/extras/d3e6bf4717c6597c0e50af7016f63c0a.webm?t=1768427011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Choose Wisely!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Pick 8 out of 15 cards at the beginning of a match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You have to come up with a deck at that moment. Look for synergies between card and make a plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">No card fits every situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405070/extras/9ea86b64c6db590b0e882efcbe5490db.poster.avif?t=1768427011\" width=610 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405070/extras/9ea86b64c6db590b0e882efcbe5490db.webm?t=1768427011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Plan your Turn</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You can sort your summoned creatures in your lane-phase:<br><u>Passive lane</u>: Safer, but cannot attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Some Abilities are not available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u>Active lane</u>: You can attack, but also be attacked easily.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">All Abilities are available.<br>Each Lane has limited slots. Lane slots can be increased during play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405070/extras/a20dd9afede1690f84669751f3442ad8.poster.avif?t=1768427011\" width=610 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405070/extras/a20dd9afede1690f84669751f3442ad8.webm?t=1768427011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Combine Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every ability has its time to shine! You just have to spot the right moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Some abilities happen to perfectly setup others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Smart combinations are the key to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405070/extras/cf2175c6c6eed15233a22e39a80dec2a.poster.avif?t=1768427011\" width=610 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405070/extras/cf2175c6c6eed15233a22e39a80dec2a.webm?t=1768427011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A Game of strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Its safe to say:<br>Trick or Beat is full of tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you enjoy those kind of games, you are gonna love Trick or Beat.<br>By the way: Trick or Beat is not only free to play, but also without any kind of pay to win.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3405070?t=1768427011","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405070/6cc3495c1874814aad9493db2450e5c2b149ee90/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768427011","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405070/b4bfedea641c9780609b72f618f47ba18b6a9620/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768427011","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405070/b4bfedea641c9780609b72f618f47ba18b6a9620/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768427011","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"